%% Transferencia con saga coreografiada + Transactional Outbox + Kafka (ADR-005)
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor C as Cliente
  participant GW as api-gateway
  participant P as payments-service
  participant PDB as paymentsdb
  participant K as Kafka
  participant A as accounts-service
  participant ADB as accountsdb
  participant U as customers-service

  C->>GW: POST /api/payments/transfer + Idempotency-Key + JWT
  GW->>P: lb:// payments-service (traceparent)
  P->>U: validar cliente (Feign · CircuitBreaker · caché)
  P->>PDB: TX: payment PENDING + outbox transactions.requested
  P-->>C: 202 PENDING
  Note over P,PDB: publicador del outbox (FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED)
  P->>K: transactions.requested (clave = paymentId)
  K->>A: SagaConsumers
  A->>ADB: TX: DÉBITO origen (UPDATE condicional balance >= monto) + processed_event + outbox
  alt saldo insuficiente o cuenta cerrada
    A->>K: transactions.failed
    K->>P: payment FAILED
  else débito correcto
    A->>K: transactions.debited
    K->>A: SagaConsumers (crédito)
    A->>ADB: TX: CRÉDITO destino (operationId paymentId:CREDIT) + outbox
    A->>K: transactions.credited
    K->>P: PaymentConsumers
    P->>PDB: TX: payment COMPLETED + outbox transactions.completed
    P->>K: transactions.completed
    K->>A: proyección: confirma movimientos
    K->>U: notificación al cliente
  end
  opt falla el crédito tras el débito
    A->>K: transactions.failed
    K->>P: COMPENSATING
    P->>A: reembolso idempotente (paymentId:REFUND · scope internal)
    P->>PDB: COMPENSATED
  end
  C->>GW: GET /api/payments/{id}
  GW-->>C: COMPLETED (historial PENDING → DEBITED → COMPLETED)
  Note over K: consumidores idempotentes (processed_event) · errores → backoff → tópico .DLT
